37
00:01:46.219 --> 00:01:57.570
Tambourine, Tambourine, Tambourine! Maracas, Maracas, Maracas! Bell, Bell, Bell! Harmonica, Harmonica, Harmonica!

38
00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:09.668
Ukulele, Ukulele, Ukulele! Xylophone, Xylophone, Xylophone! Whistle, Whistle, Whistle! Rhythm, Rhythm, Rhythm!

39
00:02:09.718 --> 00:02:12.868
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:13.552 --> 00:02:23.092
Let's make music! Shake, shake the maracas. Tap, tap the tambourine. Malis plays the xylophone, and we dance to the rhythm.

41
00:02:23.142 --> 00:02:25.705
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:26.586 --> 00:02:32.346
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:32.396 --> 00:02:34.804
Bell! Well done!

44
00:02:35.976 --> 00:02:41.457
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:41.507 --> 00:02:44.269
Harmonica! Well done!

46
00:02:45.642 --> 00:02:51.008
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:51.058 --> 00:02:53.636
Xylophone! Well done!

48
00:02:54.909 --> 00:02:56.679
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:56.729 --> 00:03:00.645
Shake the maracas. Blow the whistle.

50
00:03:00.695 --> 00:03:05.235
Your turn!

51
00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:08.587
Shake the maracas. Blow the whistle.

52
00:03:09.342 --> 00:03:14.356
What music do you like to make?

53
00:03:14.406 --> 00:03:16.315
Shake the maracas.

54
00:03:16.365 --> 00:03:17.661
Great answer!

55
00:03:18.909 --> 00:03:24.020
Today's value is cooperation. Play music together with friends.

56
